st to Walmart to look at obviously  how do you address that I don't know  that's up to them to decide but I think  what we see is that we empower the end  user much more than just by going to a  store and pick something that is  available on a shell throw we enable  people to be involved in the products  and I think they like what's the what's  the product do you have a kind of holy  grail product that you you know that  you'll know ok I finally reached the  endpoint when I when I produce this  thing I don't think there is an endpoint  I mean it's about like music songs keep  coming out I mean we have written so  many songs you know so many songs have  been written and still great new songs  come out the same will happen to product  and the same will happen to technology  it will get better and better actually I  think what we want to do as Shapeways is  not be about 3d printing but be about  empowering people to get products they  want well we'll end it there I want to  thank Peter why Mars Heusen why more  housing excuse me of Shapeways 3d  printing firm based in New York for  reason TV I'm Nicholas

